WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.560
¿Me extrañaste, Mason?

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.120
Are you upset?

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:18.640
Is the tension

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.480
between you and Greg

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.880
because of me?

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.120
Don't flatter yourself.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.800
Don’t be mad at him.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.960
Be mad at me.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.240
He also speaks so highly of you.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.800
Mind if I take my seat?

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.800
I would like to sit with my husband.
